title: How to Migrate from React Router v7
---
NIFT_TANSTACK_DOCUMENT_V1
{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This guide provides a step-by-step process to migrate your application from React Router v7 to TanStack Router. We'll cover the complete migration process from removing React Router dependencies to implementing TanStack Router's type-safe routing patterns."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"quick-start","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Quick Start"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Time Required:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" 2-4 hours depending on app complexity\n"},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Difficulty:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" Intermediate\n"},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Prerequisites:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" Basic React knowledge, existing React Router v7 app"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"what-you-ll-accomplish","children":[{"type":"text","value":"What You'll Accomplish"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Remove React Router v7 dependencies and components"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install and configure TanStack Router"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Convert route definitions to file-based routing"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Update navigation components and hooks"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Implement type-safe routing patterns"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Handle search params and dynamic routes"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Migrate from React Router v7's new features to TanStack Router equivalents"}]}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"complete-migration-process","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Complete Migration Process"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"step-1-prepare-for-migration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Step 1: Prepare for Migration"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Before making any changes, prepare your environment and codebase:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"1.1 Create a backup branch"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"git checkout -b migrate-to-tanstack-router\ngit push -u origin migrate-to-tanstack-router","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"1.2 Install TanStack Router (keep React Router temporarily)"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"# Install TanStack Router\nnpm install @tanstack/react-router\n\n# Install development dependencies\nnpm install -D @tanstack/router-plugin @tanstack/react-router-devtools","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"1.3 Set up the router plugin for your bundler"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"For "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vite"}]},{"type":"text","value":" users, update your "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"vite.config.ts"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { defineConfig } from 'vite'\nimport react from '@vitejs/plugin-react'\nimport { tanstackRouter } from '@tanstack/router-plugin/vite'\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [\n    tanstackRouter(), // Add this before react plugin\n    react(),\n  ],\n})","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"For "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"other bundlers"}]},{"type":"text","value":", see our "},{"type":"link","href":"../routing/routing-concepts.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"bundler configuration guides"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"step-2-create-tanstack-router-configuration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Step 2: Create TanStack Router Configuration"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"2.1 Create router configuration file"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tsr.config.json"},{"type":"text","value":" in your project root:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"routesDirectory\": \"./src/routes\",\n  \"generatedRouteTree\": \"./src/routeTree.gen.ts\",\n  \"quoteStyle\": \"single\"\n}","lang":"json"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"2.2 Create routes directory"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"mkdir src/routes","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"step-3-convert-your-react-router-v7-structure","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Step 3: Convert Your React Router v7 Structure"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"3.1 Identify your current React Router v7 setup"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7 introduced several new patterns. Look for:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createBrowserRouter"},{"type":"text","value":" with new data APIs"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Framework mode configurations"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Server-side rendering setup"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"New "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"loader"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"action"},{"type":"text","value":" functions"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defer"},{"type":"text","value":" usage (simplified in v7)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type-safe routing features"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"3.2 Create root route"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"src/routes/__root.tsx"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createRootRoute, Link, Outlet } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { TanStackRouterDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-router-devtools'\n\nexport const Route = createRootRoute({\n  component: () => (\n    <>\n      {/* Your existing layout/navbar content */}\n      <div className=\"p-2 flex gap-2\">\n        <Link to=\"/\" className=\"[&.active]:font-bold\">\n          Home\n        </Link>\n        <Link to=\"/about\" className=\"[&.active]:font-bold\">\n          About\n        </Link>\n      </div>\n      <hr />\n      <Outlet />\n      <TanStackRouterDevtools />\n    </>\n  ),\n})","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"3.3 Create index route"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"src/routes/index.tsx"},{"type":"text","value":" for your home page:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/')({\n  component: Index,\n})\n\nfunction Index() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"p-2\">\n      <h3>Welcome Home!</h3>\n    </div>\n  )\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"3.4 Convert React Router v7 loaders"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7 simplified loader patterns. Here's how to migrate them:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7:"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"// app/routes/posts.tsx\nexport async function loader() {\n  const posts = await fetchPosts()\n  return { posts } // v7 removed need for json() wrapper\n}\n\nexport default function Posts() {\n  const { posts } = useLoaderData()\n  return <div>{/* render posts */}</div>\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Router equivalent:"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\nCreate "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"src/routes/posts.tsx"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/posts')({\n  loader: async () => {\n    const posts = await fetchPosts()\n    return { posts }\n  },\n  component: Posts,\n})\n\nfunction Posts() {\n  const { posts } = Route.useLoaderData()\n  return <div>{/* render posts */}</div>\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"3.5 Convert dynamic routes"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7:"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"// app/routes/posts.$postId.tsx\nexport async function loader({ params }) {\n  const post = await fetchPost(params.postId)\n  return { post }\n}\n\nexport default function Post() {\n  const { post } = useLoaderData()\n  return <div>{post.title}</div>\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Router equivalent:"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\nCreate "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"src/routes/posts/$postId.tsx"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/posts/$postId')({\n  loader: async ({ params }) => {\n    const post = await fetchPost(params.postId)\n    return { post }\n  },\n  component: Post,\n})\n\nfunction Post() {\n  const { post } = Route.useLoaderData()\n  const { postId } = Route.useParams()\n  return <div>{post.title}</div>\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"3.6 Convert React Router v7 actions"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7:"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"export async function action({ request, params }) {\n  const formData = await request.formData()\n  const result = await updatePost(params.postId, formData)\n  return { success: true }\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Router equivalent:"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"export const Route = createFileRoute('/posts/$postId/edit')({\n  component: EditPost,\n  // Actions are typically handled differently in TanStack Router\n  // Use mutations or form libraries like React Hook Form\n})\n\nfunction EditPost() {\n  const navigate = useNavigate()\n\n  const handleSubmit = async (formData) => {\n    const result = await updatePost(params.postId, formData)\n    navigate({ to: '/posts/$postId', params: { postId } })\n  }\n\n  return <form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>{/* form */}</form>\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"step-4-handle-react-router-v7-framework-features","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Step 4: Handle React Router v7 Framework Features"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"4.1 Server-Side Rendering Migration"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7 introduced framework mode with SSR. If you're using this:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7 Framework Mode:"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"// react-router.config.ts\nexport default {\n  ssr: true,\n  prerender: ['/'],\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Router approach:"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Router has built-in SSR capabilities. Set up your router for SSR:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// src/router.tsx\nimport { createRouter } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { routeTree } from './routeTree.gen'\n\nconst router = createRouter({\n  routeTree,\n  context: {\n    // Add any SSR context here\n  },\n})\n\ndeclare module '@tanstack/react-router' {\n  interface Register {\n    router: typeof router\n  }\n}\n\nexport { router }","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"For server-side rendering, use TanStack Router's built-in SSR APIs:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// server.tsx\nimport { createMemoryHistory } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { StartServer } from '@tanstack/start/server'\n\nexport async function render(url: string) {\n  const router = createRouter({\n    routeTree,\n    history: createMemoryHistory({ initialEntries: [url] }),\n  })\n\n  await router.load()\n\n  return (\n    <StartServer router={router} />\n  )\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"4.2 Code Splitting Migration"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7 improved code splitting. TanStack Router handles this via lazy routes:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7:"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"const LazyComponent = lazy(() => import('./LazyComponent'))","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Router:"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createLazyFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nexport const Route = createLazyFileRoute('/lazy-route')({\n  component: LazyComponent,\n})\n\nfunction LazyComponent() {\n  return <div>Lazy loaded!</div>\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"step-5-update-navigation-components","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Step 5: Update Navigation Components"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"5.1 Update Link components"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7:"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { Link } from 'react-router'\n\n<Link to=\"/posts/123\">View Post</Link>\n<Link to=\"/posts\" state={{ from: 'home' }}>Posts</Link>","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Router:"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { Link } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\n<Link to=\"/posts/$postId\" params={{ postId: '123' }}>View Post</Link>\n<Link to=\"/posts\" state={{ from: 'home' }}>Posts</Link>","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"5.2 Update navigation hooks"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7:"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { useNavigate } from 'react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const navigate = useNavigate()\n\n  const handleClick = () => {\n    navigate('/posts/123')\n  }\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Router:"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { useNavigate } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const navigate = useNavigate()\n\n  const handleClick = () => {\n    navigate({ to: '/posts/$postId', params: { postId: '123' } })\n  }\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"step-6-handle-react-router-v7-specific-features","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Step 6: Handle React Router v7 Specific Features"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"6.1 Migrate simplified "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defer"},{"type":"text","value":" usage"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7 simplified defer by removing the wrapper function:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7:"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"export async function loader() {\n  return {\n    data: fetchData(), // Promise directly returned\n  }\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Router:"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Router uses a different approach for deferred data. Use loading states:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"export const Route = createFileRoute('/deferred')({\n  loader: async () => {\n    const data = await fetchData()\n    return { data }\n  },\n  pendingComponent: () => <div>Loading...</div>,\n  component: DeferredComponent,\n})","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"6.2 Handle React Router v7's enhanced type safety"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7 improved type inference. TanStack Router provides even better type safety:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// TanStack Router automatically infers types\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/posts/$postId')({\n  loader: async ({ params }) => {\n    // params.postId is automatically typed as string\n    const post = await fetchPost(params.postId)\n    return { post }\n  },\n  component: Post,\n})\n\nfunction Post() {\n  // post is automatically typed based on loader return\n  const { post } = Route.useLoaderData()\n  // postId is automatically typed as string\n  const { postId } = Route.useParams()\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"step-7-update-your-main-router-setup","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Step 7: Update Your Main Router Setup"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"7.1 Replace React Router v7 router creation"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Before (React Router v7):"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createBrowserRouter, RouterProvider } from 'react-router'\n\nconst router = createBrowserRouter([\n  // Your route definitions\n])\n\nReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <React.StrictMode>\n    <RouterProvider router={router} />\n  </React.StrictMode>,\n)","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"After (TanStack Router):"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { RouterProvider } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { router } from './router'\n\nReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <React.StrictMode>\n    <RouterProvider router={router} />\n  </React.StrictMode>,\n)","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"step-8-handle-search-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Step 8: Handle Search Parameters"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"8.1 React Router v7 to TanStack Router search params"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7:"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { useSearchParams } from 'react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const [searchParams, setSearchParams] = useSearchParams()\n  const page = searchParams.get('page') || '1'\n\n  const updatePage = (newPage) => {\n    setSearchParams({ page: newPage })\n  }\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Router:"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { z } from 'zod'\n\nconst searchSchema = z.object({\n  page: z.number().catch(1),\n  filter: z.string().optional(),\n})\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/posts')({\n  validateSearch: searchSchema,\n  component: Posts,\n})\n\nfunction Posts() {\n  const navigate = useNavigate({ from: '/posts' })\n  const { page, filter } = Route.useSearch()\n\n  const updatePage = (newPage: number) => {\n    navigate({ search: (prev) => ({ ...prev, page: newPage }) })\n  }\n}","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"step-9-remove-react-router-dependencies","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Step 9: Remove React Router Dependencies"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Only after everything is working with TanStack Router:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"9.1 Remove React Router v7"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm uninstall react-router","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"9.2 Clean up unused imports"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Search your codebase for any remaining React Router imports:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"# Find remaining React Router imports\ngrep -r \"react-router\" src/","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Remove any remaining imports and replace with TanStack Router equivalents."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"step-10-add-advanced-type-safety","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Step 10: Add Advanced Type Safety"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"10.1 Configure strict TypeScript"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Update your "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tsconfig.json"},{"type":"text","value":":"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"noUncheckedIndexedAccess\": true\n  }\n}","lang":"json"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"10.2 Add search parameter validation"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"For routes with search parameters, add validation schemas:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { z } from 'zod'\n\nconst postsSearchSchema = z.object({\n  page: z.number().min(1).catch(1),\n  search: z.string().optional(),\n  category: z.enum(['tech', 'business', 'lifestyle']).optional(),\n})\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/posts')({\n  validateSearch: postsSearchSchema,\n  component: Posts,\n})","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"production-checklist","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Production Checklist"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Before deploying your migrated application:"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"router-configuration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Router Configuration"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Router instance created and properly exported"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Route tree generated successfully"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TypeScript declarations registered"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All route files follow naming conventions"}]}],"checked":false}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"route-migration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Route Migration"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All React Router v7 routes converted to file-based routing"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Dynamic routes updated with proper parameter syntax"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Nested routes maintain hierarchy"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Index routes created where needed"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Layout routes preserve component structure"}]}],"checked":false}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"feature-migration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Feature Migration"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All React Router v7 loaders converted"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Actions migrated to appropriate patterns"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Server-side rendering configured (if applicable)"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Code splitting implemented"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type safety enhanced"}]}],"checked":false}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"navigation-updates","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Navigation Updates"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All Link components updated to TanStack Router"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"useNavigate hooks replaced and tested"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Navigation parameters properly typed"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Search parameter validation implemented"}]}],"checked":false}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"code-cleanup","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Code Cleanup"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7 dependencies removed"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Unused imports cleaned up"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"No React Router references remain"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TypeScript compilation successful"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All tests passing"}]}],"checked":false}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"testing","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Testing"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All routes accessible and rendering correctly"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Navigation between routes working"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Back/forward browser buttons functional"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Search parameters persisting correctly"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Dynamic routes with parameters working"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Nested route layouts displaying properly"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Framework features (SSR, code splitting) working if applicable"}]}],"checked":false}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"common-problems","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Common Problems"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"error-cannot-use-usenavigate-outside-of-context","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Error: \"Cannot use useNavigate outside of context\""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Problem:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" You have remaining React Router imports that conflict with TanStack Router."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solution:"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Search for all React Router imports:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"grep -r \"react-router\" src/","lang":"bash"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Replace all imports with TanStack Router equivalents"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Ensure React Router is completely uninstalled"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"typescript-errors-route-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TypeScript Errors: Route Parameters"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Problem:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" TypeScript showing errors about route parameters not being typed correctly."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solution:"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Ensure your router is registered in the TypeScript module declaration:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"declare module '@tanstack/react-router' {\n  interface Register {\n    router: typeof router\n  }\n}","lang":"typescript"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Check that your route files export the Route correctly"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Verify parameter names match between route definition and usage"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"react-router-v7-framework-features-not-working","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7 Framework Features Not Working"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Problem:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" Missing SSR or code splitting functionality after migration."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solution:"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Router has built-in SSR capabilities - use TanStack Start for full-stack applications"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use TanStack Router's lazy routes for code splitting"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configure SSR using TanStack Router's native APIs"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Follow the "},{"type":"link","href":"./setup-ssr.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"SSR setup guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":" for detailed instructions"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"routes-not-matching","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Routes Not Matching"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Problem:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" Routes not rendering or 404 errors for valid routes."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solution:"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Check file naming follows TanStack Router conventions:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Dynamic routes: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"$paramName.tsx"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Index routes: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"index.tsx"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Nested routes: proper directory structure"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Verify route tree generation is working"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Check that the router plugin is properly configured"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"react-router-v7-simplified-apis-not-translating","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7 Simplified APIs Not Translating"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Problem:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" v7's simplified "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defer"},{"type":"text","value":" or other features don't have direct equivalents."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solution:"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use TanStack Router's pending states for loading UX"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Implement data fetching patterns that fit TanStack Router's architecture"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Leverage TanStack Router's superior type safety for better DX"}]}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"react-router-v7-vs-tanstack-router-feature-comparison","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7 vs TanStack Router Feature Comparison"}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Feature"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Router"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Safety"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Good"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Excellent"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"File-based Routing"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Framework mode only"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Built-in"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Search Params"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Basic"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Validated with schemas"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Code Splitting"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Good"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Excellent with lazy routes"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"SSR"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Framework mode"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Built-in with TanStack Start"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Bundle Size"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Larger"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Smaller"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Learning Curve"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Moderate"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Moderate"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Community"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Large"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Growing"}]}]]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"common-next-steps","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Common Next Steps"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"After successfully migrating to TanStack Router, consider these enhancements:"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"advanced-features-to-explore","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Advanced Features to Explore"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Route-based code splitting"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Improve performance with lazy loading"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Search parameter validation"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Type-safe URL state management"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Route preloading"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Enhance perceived performance"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Route masking"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Advanced URL management"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Integration with TanStack Query"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Powerful data fetching"}]}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"related-resources","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Related Resources"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://tanstack.com/router","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Router Documentation"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Complete API reference"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../routing/file-based-routing.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"File-Based Routing Guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Detailed routing concepts"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../guide/navigation.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Navigation Guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Complete navigation patterns"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../guide/search-params.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Search Parameters Guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Advanced search param usage"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../guide/type-safety.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Safety Guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - TypeScript integration details"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://reactrouter.com/start/changelog","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7 Changelog"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - What changed in v7"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"quick-start","text":"Quick Start","level":2},{"id":"what-you-ll-accomplish","text":"What You'll Accomplish","level":3},{"id":"complete-migration-process","text":"Complete Migration Process","level":2},{"id":"step-1-prepare-for-migration","text":"Step 1: Prepare for Migration","level":3},{"id":"step-2-create-tanstack-router-configuration","text":"Step 2: Create TanStack Router Configuration","level":3},{"id":"step-3-convert-your-react-router-v7-structure","text":"Step 3: Convert Your React Router v7 Structure","level":3},{"id":"step-4-handle-react-router-v7-framework-features","text":"Step 4: Handle React Router v7 Framework Features","level":3},{"id":"step-5-update-navigation-components","text":"Step 5: Update Navigation Components","level":3},{"id":"step-6-handle-react-router-v7-specific-features","text":"Step 6: Handle React Router v7 Specific Features","level":3},{"id":"step-7-update-your-main-router-setup","text":"Step 7: Update Your Main Router Setup","level":3},{"id":"step-8-handle-search-parameters","text":"Step 8: Handle Search Parameters","level":3},{"id":"step-9-remove-react-router-dependencies","text":"Step 9: Remove React Router Dependencies","level":3},{"id":"step-10-add-advanced-type-safety","text":"Step 10: Add Advanced Type Safety","level":3},{"id":"production-checklist","text":"Production Checklist","level":2},{"id":"router-configuration","text":"Router Configuration","level":3},{"id":"route-migration","text":"Route Migration","level":3},{"id":"feature-migration","text":"Feature Migration","level":3},{"id":"navigation-updates","text":"Navigation Updates","level":3},{"id":"code-cleanup","text":"Code Cleanup","level":3},{"id":"testing","text":"Testing","level":3},{"id":"common-problems","text":"Common Problems","level":2},{"id":"error-cannot-use-usenavigate-outside-of-context","text":"Error: \"Cannot use useNavigate outside of context\"","level":3},{"id":"typescript-errors-route-parameters","text":"TypeScript Errors: Route Parameters","level":3},{"id":"react-router-v7-framework-features-not-working","text":"React Router v7 Framework Features Not Working","level":3},{"id":"routes-not-matching","text":"Routes Not Matching","level":3},{"id":"react-router-v7-simplified-apis-not-translating","text":"React Router v7 Simplified APIs Not Translating","level":3},{"id":"react-router-v7-vs-tanstack-router-feature-comparison","text":"React Router v7 vs TanStack Router Feature Comparison","level":2},{"id":"common-next-steps","text":"Common Next Steps","level":2},{"id":"advanced-features-to-explore","text":"Advanced Features to Explore","level":3},{"id":"related-resources","text":"Related Resources","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThis guide provides a step-by-step process to migrate your application from React Router v7 to TanStack Router. We'll cover the complete migration process from removing React Router dependencies to implementing TanStack Router's type-safe routing patterns.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Time Required:** 2-4 hours depending on app complexity  \n**Difficulty:** Intermediate  \n**Prerequisites:** Basic React knowledge, existing React Router v7 app\n\n### What You'll Accomplish\n\n- Remove React Router v7 dependencies and components\n- Install and configure TanStack Router\n- Convert route definitions to file-based routing\n- Update navigation components and hooks\n- Implement type-safe routing patterns\n- Handle search params and dynamic routes\n- Migrate from React Router v7's new features to TanStack Router equivalents\n\n---\n\n## Complete Migration Process\n\n### Step 1: Prepare for Migration\n\nBefore making any changes, prepare your environment and codebase:\n\n**1.1 Create a backup branch**\n\n```bash\ngit checkout -b migrate-to-tanstack-router\ngit push -u origin migrate-to-tanstack-router\n```\n\n**1.2 Install TanStack Router (keep React Router temporarily)**\n\n```bash\n# Install TanStack Router\nnpm install @tanstack/react-router\n\n# Install development dependencies\nnpm install -D @tanstack/router-plugin @tanstack/react-router-devtools\n```\n\n**1.3 Set up the router plugin for your bundler**\n\nFor **Vite** users, update your `vite.config.ts`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { defineConfig } from 'vite'\nimport react from '@vitejs/plugin-react'\nimport { tanstackRouter } from '@tanstack/router-plugin/vite'\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [\n    tanstackRouter(), // Add this before react plugin\n    react(),\n  ],\n})\n```\n\nFor **other bundlers**, see our [bundler configuration guides](../routing/routing-concepts.md).\n\n### Step 2: Create TanStack Router Configuration\n\n**2.1 Create router configuration file**\n\nCreate `tsr.config.json` in your project root:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"routesDirectory\": \"./src/routes\",\n  \"generatedRouteTree\": \"./src/routeTree.gen.ts\",\n  \"quoteStyle\": \"single\"\n}\n```\n\n**2.2 Create routes directory**\n\n```bash\nmkdir src/routes\n```\n\n### Step 3: Convert Your React Router v7 Structure\n\n**3.1 Identify your current React Router v7 setup**\n\nReact Router v7 introduced several new patterns. Look for:\n\n- `createBrowserRouter` with new data APIs\n- Framework mode configurations\n- Server-side rendering setup\n- New `loader` and `action` functions\n- `defer` usage (simplified in v7)\n- Type-safe routing features\n\n**3.2 Create root route**\n\nCreate `src/routes/__root.tsx`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createRootRoute, Link, Outlet } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { TanStackRouterDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-router-devtools'\n\nexport const Route = createRootRoute({\n  component: () => (\n    <>\n      {/* Your existing layout/navbar content */}\n      <div className=\"p-2 flex gap-2\">\n        <Link to=\"/\" className=\"[&.active]:font-bold\">\n          Home\n        </Link>\n        <Link to=\"/about\" className=\"[&.active]:font-bold\">\n          About\n        </Link>\n      </div>\n      <hr />\n      <Outlet />\n      <TanStackRouterDevtools />\n    </>\n  ),\n})\n```\n\n**3.3 Create index route**\n\nCreate `src/routes/index.tsx` for your home page:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/')({\n  component: Index,\n})\n\nfunction Index() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"p-2\">\n      <h3>Welcome Home!</h3>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**3.4 Convert React Router v7 loaders**\n\nReact Router v7 simplified loader patterns. Here's how to migrate them:\n\n**React Router v7:**\n\n```typescript\n// app/routes/posts.tsx\nexport async function loader() {\n  const posts = await fetchPosts()\n  return { posts } // v7 removed need for json() wrapper\n}\n\nexport default function Posts() {\n  const { posts } = useLoaderData()\n  return <div>{/* render posts */}</div>\n}\n```\n\n**TanStack Router equivalent:**\nCreate `src/routes/posts.tsx`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/posts')({\n  loader: async () => {\n    const posts = await fetchPosts()\n    return { posts }\n  },\n  component: Posts,\n})\n\nfunction Posts() {\n  const { posts } = Route.useLoaderData()\n  return <div>{/* render posts */}</div>\n}\n```\n\n**3.5 Convert dynamic routes**\n\n**React Router v7:**\n\n```typescript\n// app/routes/posts.$postId.tsx\nexport async function loader({ params }) {\n  const post = await fetchPost(params.postId)\n  return { post }\n}\n\nexport default function Post() {\n  const { post } = useLoaderData()\n  return <div>{post.title}</div>\n}\n```\n\n**TanStack Router equivalent:**\nCreate `src/routes/posts/$postId.tsx`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/posts/$postId')({\n  loader: async ({ params }) => {\n    const post = await fetchPost(params.postId)\n    return { post }\n  },\n  component: Post,\n})\n\nfunction Post() {\n  const { post } = Route.useLoaderData()\n  const { postId } = Route.useParams()\n  return <div>{post.title}</div>\n}\n```\n\n**3.6 Convert React Router v7 actions**\n\n**React Router v7:**\n\n```typescript\nexport async function action({ request, params }) {\n  const formData = await request.formData()\n  const result = await updatePost(params.postId, formData)\n  return { success: true }\n}\n```\n\n**TanStack Router equivalent:**\n\n```typescript\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/posts/$postId/edit')({\n  component: EditPost,\n  // Actions are typically handled differently in TanStack Router\n  // Use mutations or form libraries like React Hook Form\n})\n\nfunction EditPost() {\n  const navigate = useNavigate()\n\n  const handleSubmit = async (formData) => {\n    const result = await updatePost(params.postId, formData)\n    navigate({ to: '/posts/$postId', params: { postId } })\n  }\n\n  return <form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>{/* form */}</form>\n}\n```\n\n### Step 4: Handle React Router v7 Framework Features\n\n**4.1 Server-Side Rendering Migration**\n\nReact Router v7 introduced framework mode with SSR. If you're using this:\n\n**React Router v7 Framework Mode:**\n\n```typescript\n// react-router.config.ts\nexport default {\n  ssr: true,\n  prerender: ['/'],\n}\n```\n\n**TanStack Router approach:**\n\nTanStack Router has built-in SSR capabilities. Set up your router for SSR:\n\n```typescript\n// src/router.tsx\nimport { createRouter } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { routeTree } from './routeTree.gen'\n\nconst router = createRouter({\n  routeTree,\n  context: {\n    // Add any SSR context here\n  },\n})\n\ndeclare module '@tanstack/react-router' {\n  interface Register {\n    router: typeof router\n  }\n}\n\nexport { router }\n```\n\nFor server-side rendering, use TanStack Router's built-in SSR APIs:\n\n```typescript\n// server.tsx\nimport { createMemoryHistory } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { StartServer } from '@tanstack/start/server'\n\nexport async function render(url: string) {\n  const router = createRouter({\n    routeTree,\n    history: createMemoryHistory({ initialEntries: [url] }),\n  })\n\n  await router.load()\n\n  return (\n    <StartServer router={router} />\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**4.2 Code Splitting Migration**\n\nReact Router v7 improved code splitting. TanStack Router handles this via lazy routes:\n\n**React Router v7:**\n\n```typescript\nconst LazyComponent = lazy(() => import('./LazyComponent'))\n```\n\n**TanStack Router:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { createLazyFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nexport const Route = createLazyFileRoute('/lazy-route')({\n  component: LazyComponent,\n})\n\nfunction LazyComponent() {\n  return <div>Lazy loaded!</div>\n}\n```\n\n### Step 5: Update Navigation Components\n\n**5.1 Update Link components**\n\n**React Router v7:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { Link } from 'react-router'\n\n<Link to=\"/posts/123\">View Post</Link>\n<Link to=\"/posts\" state={{ from: 'home' }}>Posts</Link>\n```\n\n**TanStack Router:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { Link } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\n<Link to=\"/posts/$postId\" params={{ postId: '123' }}>View Post</Link>\n<Link to=\"/posts\" state={{ from: 'home' }}>Posts</Link>\n```\n\n**5.2 Update navigation hooks**\n\n**React Router v7:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { useNavigate } from 'react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const navigate = useNavigate()\n\n  const handleClick = () => {\n    navigate('/posts/123')\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**TanStack Router:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { useNavigate } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const navigate = useNavigate()\n\n  const handleClick = () => {\n    navigate({ to: '/posts/$postId', params: { postId: '123' } })\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Step 6: Handle React Router v7 Specific Features\n\n**6.1 Migrate simplified `defer` usage**\n\nReact Router v7 simplified defer by removing the wrapper function:\n\n**React Router v7:**\n\n```typescript\nexport async function loader() {\n  return {\n    data: fetchData(), // Promise directly returned\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**TanStack Router:**\n\nTanStack Router uses a different approach for deferred data. Use loading states:\n\n```typescript\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/deferred')({\n  loader: async () => {\n    const data = await fetchData()\n    return { data }\n  },\n  pendingComponent: () => <div>Loading...</div>,\n  component: DeferredComponent,\n})\n```\n\n**6.2 Handle React Router v7's enhanced type safety**\n\nReact Router v7 improved type inference. TanStack Router provides even better type safety:\n\n```typescript\n// TanStack Router automatically infers types\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/posts/$postId')({\n  loader: async ({ params }) => {\n    // params.postId is automatically typed as string\n    const post = await fetchPost(params.postId)\n    return { post }\n  },\n  component: Post,\n})\n\nfunction Post() {\n  // post is automatically typed based on loader return\n  const { post } = Route.useLoaderData()\n  // postId is automatically typed as string\n  const { postId } = Route.useParams()\n}\n```\n\n### Step 7: Update Your Main Router Setup\n\n**7.1 Replace React Router v7 router creation**\n\n**Before (React Router v7):**\n\n```typescript\nimport { createBrowserRouter, RouterProvider } from 'react-router'\n\nconst router = createBrowserRouter([\n  // Your route definitions\n])\n\nReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <React.StrictMode>\n    <RouterProvider router={router} />\n  </React.StrictMode>,\n)\n```\n\n**After (TanStack Router):**\n\n```typescript\nimport { RouterProvider } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { router } from './router'\n\nReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <React.StrictMode>\n    <RouterProvider router={router} />\n  </React.StrictMode>,\n)\n```\n\n### Step 8: Handle Search Parameters\n\n**8.1 React Router v7 to TanStack Router search params**\n\n**React Router v7:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { useSearchParams } from 'react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const [searchParams, setSearchParams] = useSearchParams()\n  const page = searchParams.get('page') || '1'\n\n  const updatePage = (newPage) => {\n    setSearchParams({ page: newPage })\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**TanStack Router:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { z } from 'zod'\n\nconst searchSchema = z.object({\n  page: z.number().catch(1),\n  filter: z.string().optional(),\n})\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/posts')({\n  validateSearch: searchSchema,\n  component: Posts,\n})\n\nfunction Posts() {\n  const navigate = useNavigate({ from: '/posts' })\n  const { page, filter } = Route.useSearch()\n\n  const updatePage = (newPage: number) => {\n    navigate({ search: (prev) => ({ ...prev, page: newPage }) })\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Step 9: Remove React Router Dependencies\n\nOnly after everything is working with TanStack Router:\n\n**9.1 Remove React Router v7**\n\n```bash\nnpm uninstall react-router\n```\n\n**9.2 Clean up unused imports**\n\nSearch your codebase for any remaining React Router imports:\n\n```bash\n# Find remaining React Router imports\ngrep -r \"react-router\" src/\n```\n\nRemove any remaining imports and replace with TanStack Router equivalents.\n\n### Step 10: Add Advanced Type Safety\n\n**10.1 Configure strict TypeScript**\n\nUpdate your `tsconfig.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"noUncheckedIndexedAccess\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**10.2 Add search parameter validation**\n\nFor routes with search parameters, add validation schemas:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { z } from 'zod'\n\nconst postsSearchSchema = z.object({\n  page: z.number().min(1).catch(1),\n  search: z.string().optional(),\n  category: z.enum(['tech', 'business', 'lifestyle']).optional(),\n})\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/posts')({\n  validateSearch: postsSearchSchema,\n  component: Posts,\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n## Production Checklist\n\nBefore deploying your migrated application:\n\n### Router Configuration\n\n- [ ] Router instance created and properly exported\n- [ ] Route tree generated successfully\n- [ ] TypeScript declarations registered\n- [ ] All route files follow naming conventions\n\n### Route Migration\n\n- [ ] All React Router v7 routes converted to file-based routing\n- [ ] Dynamic routes updated with proper parameter syntax\n- [ ] Nested routes maintain hierarchy\n- [ ] Index routes created where needed\n- [ ] Layout routes preserve component structure\n\n### Feature Migration\n\n- [ ] All React Router v7 loaders converted\n- [ ] Actions migrated to appropriate patterns\n- [ ] Server-side rendering configured (if applicable)\n- [ ] Code splitting implemented\n- [ ] Type safety enhanced\n\n### Navigation Updates\n\n- [ ] All Link components updated to TanStack Router\n- [ ] useNavigate hooks replaced and tested\n- [ ] Navigation parameters properly typed\n- [ ] Search parameter validation implemented\n\n### Code Cleanup\n\n- [ ] React Router v7 dependencies removed\n- [ ] Unused imports cleaned up\n- [ ] No React Router references remain\n- [ ] TypeScript compilation successful\n- [ ] All tests passing\n\n### Testing\n\n- [ ] All routes accessible and rendering correctly\n- [ ] Navigation between routes working\n- [ ] Back/forward browser buttons functional\n- [ ] Search parameters persisting correctly\n- [ ] Dynamic routes with parameters working\n- [ ] Nested route layouts displaying properly\n- [ ] Framework features (SSR, code splitting) working if applicable\n\n---\n\n## Common Problems\n\n### Error: \"Cannot use useNavigate outside of context\"\n\n**Problem:** You have remaining React Router imports that conflict with TanStack Router.\n\n**Solution:**\n\n1. Search for all React Router imports:\n   ```bash\n   grep -r \"react-router\" src/\n   ```\n2. Replace all imports with TanStack Router equivalents\n3. Ensure React Router is completely uninstalled\n\n### TypeScript Errors: Route Parameters\n\n**Problem:** TypeScript showing errors about route parameters not being typed correctly.\n\n**Solution:**\n\n1. Ensure your router is registered in the TypeScript module declaration:\n   ```typescript\n   declare module '@tanstack/react-router' {\n     interface Register {\n       router: typeof router\n     }\n   }\n   ```\n2. Check that your route files export the Route correctly\n3. Verify parameter names match between route definition and usage\n\n### React Router v7 Framework Features Not Working\n\n**Problem:** Missing SSR or code splitting functionality after migration.\n\n**Solution:**\n\n1. TanStack Router has built-in SSR capabilities - use TanStack Start for full-stack applications\n2. Use TanStack Router's lazy routes for code splitting\n3. Configure SSR using TanStack Router's native APIs\n4. Follow the [SSR setup guide](./setup-ssr.md) for detailed instructions\n\n### Routes Not Matching\n\n**Problem:** Routes not rendering or 404 errors for valid routes.\n\n**Solution:**\n\n1. Check file naming follows TanStack Router conventions:\n   - Dynamic routes: `$paramName.tsx`\n   - Index routes: `index.tsx`\n   - Nested routes: proper directory structure\n2. Verify route tree generation is working\n3. Check that the router plugin is properly configured\n\n### React Router v7 Simplified APIs Not Translating\n\n**Problem:** v7's simplified `defer` or other features don't have direct equivalents.\n\n**Solution:**\n\n1. Use TanStack Router's pending states for loading UX\n2. Implement data fetching patterns that fit TanStack Router's architecture\n3. Leverage TanStack Router's superior type safety for better DX\n\n---\n\n## React Router v7 vs TanStack Router Feature Comparison\n\n| Feature            | React Router v7     | TanStack Router              |\n| ------------------ | ------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| Type Safety        | Good                | Excellent                    |\n| File-based Routing | Framework mode only | Built-in                     |\n| Search Params      | Basic               | Validated with schemas       |\n| Code Splitting     | Good                | Excellent with lazy routes   |\n| SSR                | Framework mode      | Built-in with TanStack Start |\n| Bundle Size        | Larger              | Smaller                      |\n| Learning Curve     | Moderate            | Moderate                     |\n| Community          | Large               | Growing                      |\n\n---\n\n## Common Next Steps\n\nAfter successfully migrating to TanStack Router, consider these enhancements:\n\n### Advanced Features to Explore\n\n- **Route-based code splitting** - Improve performance with lazy loading\n- **Search parameter validation** - Type-safe URL state management\n- **Route preloading** - Enhance perceived performance\n- **Route masking** - Advanced URL management\n- **Integration with TanStack Query** - Powerful data fetching\n\n---\n\n## Related Resources\n\n- [TanStack Router Documentation](https://tanstack.com/router) - Complete API reference\n- [File-Based Routing Guide](../routing/file-based-routing.md) - Detailed routing concepts\n- [Navigation Guide](../guide/navigation.md) - Complete navigation patterns\n- [Search Parameters Guide](../guide/search-params.md) - Advanced search param usage\n- [Type Safety Guide](../guide/type-safety.md) - TypeScript integration details\n- [React Router v7 Changelog](https://reactrouter.com/start/changelog) - What changed in v7\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: How to Migrate from React Router v7\n---\n\nThis guide provides a step-by-step process to migrate your application from React Router v7 to TanStack Router. We'll cover the complete migration process from removing React Router dependencies to implementing TanStack Router's type-safe routing patterns.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Time Required:** 2-4 hours depending on app complexity  \n**Difficulty:** Intermediate  \n**Prerequisites:** Basic React knowledge, existing React Router v7 app\n\n### What You'll Accomplish\n\n- Remove React Router v7 dependencies and components\n- Install and configure TanStack Router\n- Convert route definitions to file-based routing\n- Update navigation components and hooks\n- Implement type-safe routing patterns\n- Handle search params and dynamic routes\n- Migrate from React Router v7's new features to TanStack Router equivalents\n\n---\n\n## Complete Migration Process\n\n### Step 1: Prepare for Migration\n\nBefore making any changes, prepare your environment and codebase:\n\n**1.1 Create a backup branch**\n\n```bash\ngit checkout -b migrate-to-tanstack-router\ngit push -u origin migrate-to-tanstack-router\n```\n\n**1.2 Install TanStack Router (keep React Router temporarily)**\n\n```bash\n# Install TanStack Router\nnpm install @tanstack/react-router\n\n# Install development dependencies\nnpm install -D @tanstack/router-plugin @tanstack/react-router-devtools\n```\n\n**1.3 Set up the router plugin for your bundler**\n\nFor **Vite** users, update your `vite.config.ts`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { defineConfig } from 'vite'\nimport react from '@vitejs/plugin-react'\nimport { tanstackRouter } from '@tanstack/router-plugin/vite'\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [\n    tanstackRouter(), // Add this before react plugin\n    react(),\n  ],\n})\n```\n\nFor **other bundlers**, see our [bundler configuration guides](../routing/routing-concepts.md).\n\n### Step 2: Create TanStack Router Configuration\n\n**2.1 Create router configuration file**\n\nCreate `tsr.config.json` in your project root:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"routesDirectory\": \"./src/routes\",\n  \"generatedRouteTree\": \"./src/routeTree.gen.ts\",\n  \"quoteStyle\": \"single\"\n}\n```\n\n**2.2 Create routes directory**\n\n```bash\nmkdir src/routes\n```\n\n### Step 3: Convert Your React Router v7 Structure\n\n**3.1 Identify your current React Router v7 setup**\n\nReact Router v7 introduced several new patterns. Look for:\n\n- `createBrowserRouter` with new data APIs\n- Framework mode configurations\n- Server-side rendering setup\n- New `loader` and `action` functions\n- `defer` usage (simplified in v7)\n- Type-safe routing features\n\n**3.2 Create root route**\n\nCreate `src/routes/__root.tsx`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createRootRoute, Link, Outlet } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { TanStackRouterDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-router-devtools'\n\nexport const Route = createRootRoute({\n  component: () => (\n    <>\n      {/* Your existing layout/navbar content */}\n      <div className=\"p-2 flex gap-2\">\n        <Link to=\"/\" className=\"[&.active]:font-bold\">\n          Home\n        </Link>\n        <Link to=\"/about\" className=\"[&.active]:font-bold\">\n          About\n        </Link>\n      </div>\n      <hr />\n      <Outlet />\n      <TanStackRouterDevtools />\n    </>\n  ),\n})\n```\n\n**3.3 Create index route**\n\nCreate `src/routes/index.tsx` for your home page:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/')({\n  component: Index,\n})\n\nfunction Index() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"p-2\">\n      <h3>Welcome Home!</h3>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**3.4 Convert React Router v7 loaders**\n\nReact Router v7 simplified loader patterns. Here's how to migrate them:\n\n**React Router v7:**\n\n```typescript\n// app/routes/posts.tsx\nexport async function loader() {\n  const posts = await fetchPosts()\n  return { posts } // v7 removed need for json() wrapper\n}\n\nexport default function Posts() {\n  const { posts } = useLoaderData()\n  return <div>{/* render posts */}</div>\n}\n```\n\n**TanStack Router equivalent:**\nCreate `src/routes/posts.tsx`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/posts')({\n  loader: async () => {\n    const posts = await fetchPosts()\n    return { posts }\n  },\n  component: Posts,\n})\n\nfunction Posts() {\n  const { posts } = Route.useLoaderData()\n  return <div>{/* render posts */}</div>\n}\n```\n\n**3.5 Convert dynamic routes**\n\n**React Router v7:**\n\n```typescript\n// app/routes/posts.$postId.tsx\nexport async function loader({ params }) {\n  const post = await fetchPost(params.postId)\n  return { post }\n}\n\nexport default function Post() {\n  const { post } = useLoaderData()\n  return <div>{post.title}</div>\n}\n```\n\n**TanStack Router equivalent:**\nCreate `src/routes/posts/$postId.tsx`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/posts/$postId')({\n  loader: async ({ params }) => {\n    const post = await fetchPost(params.postId)\n    return { post }\n  },\n  component: Post,\n})\n\nfunction Post() {\n  const { post } = Route.useLoaderData()\n  const { postId } = Route.useParams()\n  return <div>{post.title}</div>\n}\n```\n\n**3.6 Convert React Router v7 actions**\n\n**React Router v7:**\n\n```typescript\nexport async function action({ request, params }) {\n  const formData = await request.formData()\n  const result = await updatePost(params.postId, formData)\n  return { success: true }\n}\n```\n\n**TanStack Router equivalent:**\n\n```typescript\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/posts/$postId/edit')({\n  component: EditPost,\n  // Actions are typically handled differently in TanStack Router\n  // Use mutations or form libraries like React Hook Form\n})\n\nfunction EditPost() {\n  const navigate = useNavigate()\n\n  const handleSubmit = async (formData) => {\n    const result = await updatePost(params.postId, formData)\n    navigate({ to: '/posts/$postId', params: { postId } })\n  }\n\n  return <form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>{/* form */}</form>\n}\n```\n\n### Step 4: Handle React Router v7 Framework Features\n\n**4.1 Server-Side Rendering Migration**\n\nReact Router v7 introduced framework mode with SSR. If you're using this:\n\n**React Router v7 Framework Mode:**\n\n```typescript\n// react-router.config.ts\nexport default {\n  ssr: true,\n  prerender: ['/'],\n}\n```\n\n**TanStack Router approach:**\n\nTanStack Router has built-in SSR capabilities. Set up your router for SSR:\n\n```typescript\n// src/router.tsx\nimport { createRouter } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { routeTree } from './routeTree.gen'\n\nconst router = createRouter({\n  routeTree,\n  context: {\n    // Add any SSR context here\n  },\n})\n\ndeclare module '@tanstack/react-router' {\n  interface Register {\n    router: typeof router\n  }\n}\n\nexport { router }\n```\n\nFor server-side rendering, use TanStack Router's built-in SSR APIs:\n\n```typescript\n// server.tsx\nimport { createMemoryHistory } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { StartServer } from '@tanstack/start/server'\n\nexport async function render(url: string) {\n  const router = createRouter({\n    routeTree,\n    history: createMemoryHistory({ initialEntries: [url] }),\n  })\n\n  await router.load()\n\n  return (\n    <StartServer router={router} />\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**4.2 Code Splitting Migration**\n\nReact Router v7 improved code splitting. TanStack Router handles this via lazy routes:\n\n**React Router v7:**\n\n```typescript\nconst LazyComponent = lazy(() => import('./LazyComponent'))\n```\n\n**TanStack Router:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { createLazyFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nexport const Route = createLazyFileRoute('/lazy-route')({\n  component: LazyComponent,\n})\n\nfunction LazyComponent() {\n  return <div>Lazy loaded!</div>\n}\n```\n\n### Step 5: Update Navigation Components\n\n**5.1 Update Link components**\n\n**React Router v7:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { Link } from 'react-router'\n\n<Link to=\"/posts/123\">View Post</Link>\n<Link to=\"/posts\" state={{ from: 'home' }}>Posts</Link>\n```\n\n**TanStack Router:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { Link } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\n<Link to=\"/posts/$postId\" params={{ postId: '123' }}>View Post</Link>\n<Link to=\"/posts\" state={{ from: 'home' }}>Posts</Link>\n```\n\n**5.2 Update navigation hooks**\n\n**React Router v7:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { useNavigate } from 'react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const navigate = useNavigate()\n\n  const handleClick = () => {\n    navigate('/posts/123')\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**TanStack Router:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { useNavigate } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const navigate = useNavigate()\n\n  const handleClick = () => {\n    navigate({ to: '/posts/$postId', params: { postId: '123' } })\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Step 6: Handle React Router v7 Specific Features\n\n**6.1 Migrate simplified `defer` usage**\n\nReact Router v7 simplified defer by removing the wrapper function:\n\n**React Router v7:**\n\n```typescript\nexport async function loader() {\n  return {\n    data: fetchData(), // Promise directly returned\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**TanStack Router:**\n\nTanStack Router uses a different approach for deferred data. Use loading states:\n\n```typescript\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/deferred')({\n  loader: async () => {\n    const data = await fetchData()\n    return { data }\n  },\n  pendingComponent: () => <div>Loading...</div>,\n  component: DeferredComponent,\n})\n```\n\n**6.2 Handle React Router v7's enhanced type safety**\n\nReact Router v7 improved type inference. TanStack Router provides even better type safety:\n\n```typescript\n// TanStack Router automatically infers types\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/posts/$postId')({\n  loader: async ({ params }) => {\n    // params.postId is automatically typed as string\n    const post = await fetchPost(params.postId)\n    return { post }\n  },\n  component: Post,\n})\n\nfunction Post() {\n  // post is automatically typed based on loader return\n  const { post } = Route.useLoaderData()\n  // postId is automatically typed as string\n  const { postId } = Route.useParams()\n}\n```\n\n### Step 7: Update Your Main Router Setup\n\n**7.1 Replace React Router v7 router creation**\n\n**Before (React Router v7):**\n\n```typescript\nimport { createBrowserRouter, RouterProvider } from 'react-router'\n\nconst router = createBrowserRouter([\n  // Your route definitions\n])\n\nReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <React.StrictMode>\n    <RouterProvider router={router} />\n  </React.StrictMode>,\n)\n```\n\n**After (TanStack Router):**\n\n```typescript\nimport { RouterProvider } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { router } from './router'\n\nReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <React.StrictMode>\n    <RouterProvider router={router} />\n  </React.StrictMode>,\n)\n```\n\n### Step 8: Handle Search Parameters\n\n**8.1 React Router v7 to TanStack Router search params**\n\n**React Router v7:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { useSearchParams } from 'react-router'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const [searchParams, setSearchParams] = useSearchParams()\n  const page = searchParams.get('page') || '1'\n\n  const updatePage = (newPage) => {\n    setSearchParams({ page: newPage })\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**TanStack Router:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { z } from 'zod'\n\nconst searchSchema = z.object({\n  page: z.number().catch(1),\n  filter: z.string().optional(),\n})\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/posts')({\n  validateSearch: searchSchema,\n  component: Posts,\n})\n\nfunction Posts() {\n  const navigate = useNavigate({ from: '/posts' })\n  const { page, filter } = Route.useSearch()\n\n  const updatePage = (newPage: number) => {\n    navigate({ search: (prev) => ({ ...prev, page: newPage }) })\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Step 9: Remove React Router Dependencies\n\nOnly after everything is working with TanStack Router:\n\n**9.1 Remove React Router v7**\n\n```bash\nnpm uninstall react-router\n```\n\n**9.2 Clean up unused imports**\n\nSearch your codebase for any remaining React Router imports:\n\n```bash\n# Find remaining React Router imports\ngrep -r \"react-router\" src/\n```\n\nRemove any remaining imports and replace with TanStack Router equivalents.\n\n### Step 10: Add Advanced Type Safety\n\n**10.1 Configure strict TypeScript**\n\nUpdate your `tsconfig.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"noUncheckedIndexedAccess\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**10.2 Add search parameter validation**\n\nFor routes with search parameters, add validation schemas:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { z } from 'zod'\n\nconst postsSearchSchema = z.object({\n  page: z.number().min(1).catch(1),\n  search: z.string().optional(),\n  category: z.enum(['tech', 'business', 'lifestyle']).optional(),\n})\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/posts')({\n  validateSearch: postsSearchSchema,\n  component: Posts,\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n## Production Checklist\n\nBefore deploying your migrated application:\n\n### Router Configuration\n\n- [ ] Router instance created and properly exported\n- [ ] Route tree generated successfully\n- [ ] TypeScript declarations registered\n- [ ] All route files follow naming conventions\n\n### Route Migration\n\n- [ ] All React Router v7 routes converted to file-based routing\n- [ ] Dynamic routes updated with proper parameter syntax\n- [ ] Nested routes maintain hierarchy\n- [ ] Index routes created where needed\n- [ ] Layout routes preserve component structure\n\n### Feature Migration\n\n- [ ] All React Router v7 loaders converted\n- [ ] Actions migrated to appropriate patterns\n- [ ] Server-side rendering configured (if applicable)\n- [ ] Code splitting implemented\n- [ ] Type safety enhanced\n\n### Navigation Updates\n\n- [ ] All Link components updated to TanStack Router\n- [ ] useNavigate hooks replaced and tested\n- [ ] Navigation parameters properly typed\n- [ ] Search parameter validation implemented\n\n### Code Cleanup\n\n- [ ] React Router v7 dependencies removed\n- [ ] Unused imports cleaned up\n- [ ] No React Router references remain\n- [ ] TypeScript compilation successful\n- [ ] All tests passing\n\n### Testing\n\n- [ ] All routes accessible and rendering correctly\n- [ ] Navigation between routes working\n- [ ] Back/forward browser buttons functional\n- [ ] Search parameters persisting correctly\n- [ ] Dynamic routes with parameters working\n- [ ] Nested route layouts displaying properly\n- [ ] Framework features (SSR, code splitting) working if applicable\n\n---\n\n## Common Problems\n\n### Error: \"Cannot use useNavigate outside of context\"\n\n**Problem:** You have remaining React Router imports that conflict with TanStack Router.\n\n**Solution:**\n\n1. Search for all React Router imports:\n   ```bash\n   grep -r \"react-router\" src/\n   ```\n2. Replace all imports with TanStack Router equivalents\n3. Ensure React Router is completely uninstalled\n\n### TypeScript Errors: Route Parameters\n\n**Problem:** TypeScript showing errors about route parameters not being typed correctly.\n\n**Solution:**\n\n1. Ensure your router is registered in the TypeScript module declaration:\n   ```typescript\n   declare module '@tanstack/react-router' {\n     interface Register {\n       router: typeof router\n     }\n   }\n   ```\n2. Check that your route files export the Route correctly\n3. Verify parameter names match between route definition and usage\n\n### React Router v7 Framework Features Not Working\n\n**Problem:** Missing SSR or code splitting functionality after migration.\n\n**Solution:**\n\n1. TanStack Router has built-in SSR capabilities - use TanStack Start for full-stack applications\n2. Use TanStack Router's lazy routes for code splitting\n3. Configure SSR using TanStack Router's native APIs\n4. Follow the [SSR setup guide](./setup-ssr.md) for detailed instructions\n\n### Routes Not Matching\n\n**Problem:** Routes not rendering or 404 errors for valid routes.\n\n**Solution:**\n\n1. Check file naming follows TanStack Router conventions:\n   - Dynamic routes: `$paramName.tsx`\n   - Index routes: `index.tsx`\n   - Nested routes: proper directory structure\n2. Verify route tree generation is working\n3. Check that the router plugin is properly configured\n\n### React Router v7 Simplified APIs Not Translating\n\n**Problem:** v7's simplified `defer` or other features don't have direct equivalents.\n\n**Solution:**\n\n1. Use TanStack Router's pending states for loading UX\n2. Implement data fetching patterns that fit TanStack Router's architecture\n3. Leverage TanStack Router's superior type safety for better DX\n\n---\n\n## React Router v7 vs TanStack Router Feature Comparison\n\n| Feature            | React Router v7     | TanStack Router              |\n| ------------------ | ------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| Type Safety        | Good                | Excellent                    |\n| File-based Routing | Framework mode only | Built-in                     |\n| Search Params      | Basic               | Validated with schemas       |\n| Code Splitting     | Good                | Excellent with lazy routes   |\n| SSR                | Framework mode      | Built-in with TanStack Start |\n| Bundle Size        | Larger              | Smaller                      |\n| Learning Curve     | Moderate            | Moderate                     |\n| Community          | Large               | Growing                      |\n\n---\n\n## Common Next Steps\n\nAfter successfully migrating to TanStack Router, consider these enhancements:\n\n### Advanced Features to Explore\n\n- **Route-based code splitting** - Improve performance with lazy loading\n- **Search parameter validation** - Type-safe URL state management\n- **Route preloading** - Enhance perceived performance\n- **Route masking** - Advanced URL management\n- **Integration with TanStack Query** - Powerful data fetching\n\n---\n\n## Related Resources\n\n- [TanStack Router Documentation](https://tanstack.com/router) - Complete API reference\n- [File-Based Routing Guide](../routing/file-based-routing.md) - Detailed routing concepts\n- [Navigation Guide](../guide/navigation.md) - Complete navigation patterns\n- [Search Parameters Guide](../guide/search-params.md) - Advanced search param usage\n- [Type Safety Guide](../guide/type-safety.md) - TypeScript integration details\n- [React Router v7 Changelog](https://reactrouter.com/start/changelog) - What changed in v7\n"}
